WEBVTT

00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:07.820
"Resources" is the term used 
for the energy that is

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:06.810
Aomori

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:08.570
Toyama

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:12.070
constantly emitted from the 
Black Points all around Japan.

00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:10.320
Nara

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:12.070
Kagoshima

00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:14.590
Tokyo

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:17.120
All Z/X, without exception,

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:22.000
can only exist with a 
constant influx of resources.

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:20.930
Haunt  Dark Scar

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:22.960
Black Sword  Cursed Soul

00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:25.740
The amount of resources a Z/X requires

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:27.690
is proportionate to its strength.

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:33.530
Far away from the Black Points, 
where resource density is thin,

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:37.150
the stronger Z/X cannot last very long.

00:00:38.570 --> 00:00:39.670
However,

00:00:39.670 --> 00:00:43.980
there is one way for them to exist 
even where resources are thin:

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.480
Nine Worthies  Lancelot                 Comfy  Brazen Bull

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.960
Card Device

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:48.090
the Card Device.

00:00:50.310 --> 00:00:53.030
If someone with a Card 
Device is by their side,

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:57.420
they can draw resources from it.

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:39.840
Azumi Kagamihara              Sword Sniper  Rigel

00:02:40.110 --> 00:02:43.820
December 25th 17:42 Kobe - Kai Building

00:02:45.350 --> 00:02:46.850
Black Blade  Sieger

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:48.180
The Proud  Fierte

00:02:48.370 --> 00:02:50.690
December 25th 17:57 Cafe Broccolo

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:53.190
December 25th 17:57 Cafe Broccolo
Aina Mikage

00:02:51.590 --> 00:02:53.190
What's that?

00:02:55.830 --> 00:02:58.190
It's not a fight if you just keep dodging.

00:03:04.390 --> 00:03:05.200
Here I go!

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:10.500
Asuka! Send me more resources!

00:03:10.730 --> 00:03:14.650
Asuka Tennoji

00:03:11.450 --> 00:03:14.390
Doesn't the device do it automatically?

00:03:14.390 --> 00:03:18.130
I can't fight someone of his class 
with just the standard output!

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:21.380
Increase the supply as necessary!

00:03:21.640 --> 00:03:24.120
Match my timing and use the control!

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:25.710
The control?

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:29.710
Sieger, stop playing around.

00:03:28.490 --> 00:03:31.390
Ayase Kamiyugi

00:03:30.270 --> 00:03:31.390
Oh, come on.

00:03:31.970 --> 00:03:33.950
Let me knock her around a bit more.

00:03:33.950 --> 00:03:35.890
Do it fast.

00:03:35.890 --> 00:03:37.280
Fine, fine.

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:44.200
Rigel, save that angel.

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:47.200
Our mission is to observe her.

00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:49.160
It would cause problems

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:51.930
if we intervened in the 
fight and they saw us.

00:03:52.850 --> 00:03:55.210
If our observation target dies,

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:56.210
there's no point.

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:05.690
Permission.

00:04:11.990 --> 00:04:13.320
Target confirmed.

00:04:13.320 --> 00:04:15.290
Vertical angle: +3.

00:04:16.930 --> 00:04:18.150
Shoot!

00:04:22.090 --> 00:04:23.030
What?

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:26.890
Who are you?

00:04:26.890 --> 00:04:28.620
A Blue World Battle Dress?

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:30.490
A new Z/X?

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:32.250
Wh-What's that?

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:34.470
Black World predator...

00:04:34.470 --> 00:04:38.600
If you withdraw quietly, 
I will attack you no further.

00:04:39.110 --> 00:04:41.260
You think you're gonna take my prey?

00:04:41.810 --> 00:04:43.470
Hell no!

00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:52.400
Who is that?

00:04:55.320 --> 00:04:57.420
She is the Sword Sniper Rigel.

00:04:59.310 --> 00:05:01.430
M-Miss...

00:05:01.430 --> 00:05:04.830
I am her partner.

00:05:04.830 --> 00:05:06.700
Azumi Kagamihara.

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:13.330
Azumi!

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:14.200
Roger.

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:16.310
Resource: reboot.

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:28.220
What is this?

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:32.510
What? She powered up?

00:05:32.980 --> 00:05:34.430
You're a failure as a partner.

00:05:37.090 --> 00:05:39.100
It's the task of a partner to control

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:43.480
the supply of resources to 
your Z/X when they fight.

00:05:45.350 --> 00:05:47.030
We may not be right next to them,

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:49.190
but we're fighting with them.

00:05:52.440 --> 00:05:54.120
Resource: reboot.

00:06:09.620 --> 00:06:11.350
I'm getting tired of this.

00:06:12.840 --> 00:06:15.850
Repent, murder-obsessed monster!

00:06:16.910 --> 00:06:18.570
Don't get cocky!

00:06:18.570 --> 00:06:20.370
Withdraw, Sieger.

00:06:20.370 --> 00:06:21.360
Why?

00:06:22.840 --> 00:06:24.360
Don't make me repeat myself.

00:06:25.350 --> 00:06:27.470
Selfish little girl.

00:06:28.710 --> 00:06:30.610
Guess you get to live.

00:06:47.170 --> 00:06:49.380
Why did you save me?

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:55.680
Answer me, Blue World Battle Dress.

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:06.570
Azumi!

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:09.320
December 25th 18:35 Building Under Construction

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:09.320
Hey, wake up!

00:07:12.850 --> 00:07:13.520
Are you okay?

00:07:13.520 --> 00:07:14.450
Wake up!

00:07:14.450 --> 00:07:16.120
Hey! Hey!

00:07:16.840 --> 00:07:18.660
Miss, wake up!

00:07:17.920 --> 00:07:18.980
Release.

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:20.500
Hey! Wake up!

00:07:21.850 --> 00:07:23.190
Hey! Hey!

00:07:27.690 --> 00:07:28.340
Azumi!

00:07:37.670 --> 00:07:40.180
Hey, is she sick?

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:42.330
It's a seizure.

00:07:42.330 --> 00:07:43.450
Should we go to the hospital?

00:07:43.450 --> 00:07:44.490
Leave us alone.

00:07:44.490 --> 00:07:46.150
It'll stop in a second.

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:48.890
Shouldn't we let her lie down somewhere?

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:50.580
No need.

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:52.780
Azumi!

00:08:04.010 --> 00:08:04.960
What are you doing?

00:08:05.610 --> 00:08:07.860
We can't leave her out here in the cold!

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:09.270
Wait!

00:08:09.270 --> 00:08:10.710
Let her go!

00:08:11.030 --> 00:08:12.800
Can't you hear me?

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:19.160
You don't need to worry.

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:22.900
Asuka won't hurt her.

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:27.850
I'm okay, Rigel.

00:08:28.580 --> 00:08:29.230
Azumi.

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:31.460
I'm okay.

00:08:41.890 --> 00:08:42.750
Release.

00:08:48.770 --> 00:08:54.280
December 25th 18:17 Cafe Broccolo

00:08:51.110 --> 00:08:54.280
Cafe Broccolo Owner
Maru

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:11.520
So what is someone from 
the Blue World doing here?

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:14.860
This area belongs to the White World.

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:16.910
I can't believe someone from

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:19.560
another world would come 
here without reason.

00:09:21.570 --> 00:09:22.660
We ran.

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:24.910
Our world is at war

00:09:25.300 --> 00:09:30.470
with rebels who oppose the present system.

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:35.690
The battles are occurring 
around the Black Point, too.

00:09:36.130 --> 00:09:39.930
We were sent to fight the rebels many times.

00:09:43.700 --> 00:09:47.830
Both Azumi and I are tired of fighting.

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:51.070
I see.

00:09:51.990 --> 00:09:55.730
So, why did you choose this area?

00:09:55.730 --> 00:09:58.750
Because it's far away 
from any Black Point.

00:09:59.370 --> 00:10:02.950
We thought we could avoid 
unnecessary combat.

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:05.400
If you wish to avoid battle,

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:08.310
why did you save us when 
you didn't even know us?

00:10:08.990 --> 00:10:10.200
Because...

00:10:11.090 --> 00:10:16.120
Because if someone needs help, 
no matter who, you help them!

00:10:16.120 --> 00:10:18.630
You're the only one here who's that naïve.

00:10:20.820 --> 00:10:22.850
Hey, Fierte...

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:27.520
You seem kind of mad.

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:30.970
I've heard the Blue World denies 
the power of a noble mind,

00:10:30.970 --> 00:10:34.690
and has entrusted everything 
to machines that rule them.

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:38.100
I can't trust someone from 
a world like that so easily.

00:10:38.100 --> 00:10:40.630
You've gotta stop being 
suspicious of everyone!

00:10:40.630 --> 00:10:42.850
They said they ran away from it.

00:10:42.850 --> 00:10:44.770
Why don't we believe them?

00:10:44.770 --> 00:10:45.620
Asuka!

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:49.790
Do you trust them more 
than you trust me?

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:12.970
Wow.

00:11:13.970 --> 00:11:19.620
Asuka, will you be paying for all this?

00:11:21.420 --> 00:11:22.450
It's okay.

00:11:24.570 --> 00:11:25.980
That's a black card!

00:11:25.980 --> 00:11:28.290
You can only get one if your yearly 
salary is in the billions of yen!

00:11:28.720 --> 00:11:32.670
But we don't take credit cards.

00:11:32.560 --> 00:11:33.770
<b>Oh...</b>

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:37.090
So, it'll be coming out of your salary.

00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:39.390
So that's how it goes, huh?

00:11:40.770 --> 00:11:42.320
Lend me an apron.

00:11:43.880 --> 00:11:45.590
Miss...

00:11:45.590 --> 00:11:48.040
Are you going to work to pay it off?

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:48.730
Yes.

00:11:48.730 --> 00:11:50.880
No! It's fine! It's okay!

00:11:50.880 --> 00:11:51.640
Just sit down.

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:52.190
But...

00:11:52.190 --> 00:11:53.650
Really, it's fine.

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:55.980
We're leaving, Azumi.

00:11:55.980 --> 00:11:57.230
Wait!

00:11:57.720 --> 00:11:59.520
What's gotten into you?

00:11:59.520 --> 00:12:01.930
You've done a lot to help Azumi.

00:12:03.050 --> 00:12:04.220
Thank you.

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:20.420
December 25th 21:15 Kobe City

00:12:21.770 --> 00:12:23.180
Hey!

00:12:29.050 --> 00:12:31.000
I got you a present.

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:31.930
Take it.

00:12:33.450 --> 00:12:35.230
It's a Christmas cake.

00:12:35.230 --> 00:12:39.440
If you eat the Santa on top of it, 
your wish will come true!

00:12:39.880 --> 00:12:42.520
Or so my boss said.

00:12:42.520 --> 00:12:43.950
No, thank you.

00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:47.950
Aw, don't say that.

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:50.400
You can't believe everything the boss says,

00:12:50.400 --> 00:12:52.430
but I guarantee it tastes good.

00:12:52.430 --> 00:12:54.330
I told you, we don't need it!

00:12:54.680 --> 00:12:55.750
Capture.

00:13:02.850 --> 00:13:07.840
Can I have... the cake?

00:13:07.840 --> 00:13:09.190
Sure.

00:13:09.190 --> 00:13:10.280
Take it.

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:13.850
December 25th 21:30 Cafe Broccolo

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:13.560
Honestly...

00:13:16.490 --> 00:13:18.610
Asuka is just too naïve.

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:21.360
<i>I'm going to go give 
them this present.</i>

00:13:22.240 --> 00:13:26.410
I told him you can't trust people 
from the Blue World so easily!

00:13:27.750 --> 00:13:29.370
Um...

00:13:29.990 --> 00:13:32.990
Isn't Tennoji back yet?

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:37.210
I guess I should've been able to tell that.

00:13:37.210 --> 00:13:40.290
Sorry for asking such a dumb question.

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:44.130
Um, the girls who were with you...

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:45.990
Never mind.

00:13:47.960 --> 00:13:49.050
Give me another!

00:13:54.850 --> 00:13:56.520
Coming right up.

00:13:57.750 --> 00:14:01.630
December 25th 21:57 Mountaintop Hotel

00:13:59.850 --> 00:14:02.570
Thanks for walking me home.

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:06.370
I work at that café.

00:14:06.370 --> 00:14:08.910
If you ever want some curry, 
come back and see me.

00:14:10.150 --> 00:14:11.120
Bye.

00:14:14.210 --> 00:14:15.930
Can't breathe...

00:14:15.930 --> 00:14:17.290
Wait.

00:14:23.280 --> 00:14:26.010
The way you fought was amazing.

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:28.520
You guys make a great pair!

00:14:29.260 --> 00:14:33.560
Rigel understands me better than anyone.

00:14:33.810 --> 00:14:37.060
And I understand her better than anyone.

00:14:37.320 --> 00:14:38.880
You're good friends.

00:14:38.880 --> 00:14:40.240
What about you?

00:14:40.240 --> 00:14:42.380
You mean me and Fierte?

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:45.070
Well, you could tell by watching us.

00:14:45.620 --> 00:14:48.250
I only met her yesterday, anyway.

00:14:48.250 --> 00:14:53.140
And we just happened to 
end up together, kinda...

00:14:53.890 --> 00:14:57.500
So when she's screaming at me for 
resources in the middle of a fight,

00:14:57.500 --> 00:14:59.250
I don't really know what to do.

00:15:00.600 --> 00:15:05.040
Honestly, I'd rather not help 
her fight if I didn't have to.

00:15:05.910 --> 00:15:07.310
Even if she dies?

00:15:09.810 --> 00:15:13.220
I don't want Fierte getting hurt, but...

00:15:15.110 --> 00:15:18.730
I just think there must be 
some way to avoid fighting.

00:15:25.560 --> 00:15:26.980
I think...

00:15:27.550 --> 00:15:32.240
It'd be great if we could all live 
happily and at peace together!

00:15:33.300 --> 00:15:37.530
There's no future in a world 
where everybody's grumpy!

00:15:37.530 --> 00:15:39.040
Or something?

00:15:43.300 --> 00:15:44.290
Oh, crap!

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:45.410
Look at the time!

00:15:45.410 --> 00:15:46.260
I've gotta go!

00:15:46.260 --> 00:15:48.510
Fierte's been sitting there this whole time!

00:15:49.030 --> 00:15:50.760
See you later!

00:15:56.310 --> 00:15:59.830
But I fight because I don't want to die.

00:16:01.010 --> 00:16:04.030
Is that wrong?

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:06.710
Mountaintop Hotel Suite

00:16:06.710 --> 00:16:10.800
Mountaintop Hotel Suite
December 25th 22:37

00:16:08.690 --> 00:16:11.130
You're acting strange today, Azumi.

00:16:11.130 --> 00:16:11.780
Strange?

00:16:12.260 --> 00:16:15.970
Did you forget what will happen 
if you go against the Blue World?

00:16:21.520 --> 00:16:26.150
Several Years Earlier

00:16:26.230 --> 00:16:27.290
Am I

00:16:29.010 --> 00:16:30.470
going to die?

00:16:33.400 --> 00:16:34.350
Yes.

00:16:38.370 --> 00:16:39.230
Who are you?

00:16:39.850 --> 00:16:44.390
With the technology of your world, 
no one can find the cause of your illness,

00:16:44.390 --> 00:16:46.350
let alone cure it.

00:16:47.600 --> 00:16:49.610
The seizures will continue,

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:51.560
the pain will increase,

00:16:51.560 --> 00:16:53.610
and the disease will progress.

00:16:54.340 --> 00:16:59.240
You will simply wait to die, 
powerless to stop it,

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:02.020
tortured by despair and solitude.

00:17:04.650 --> 00:17:09.380
But if you help us, 
your death can be avoided.

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:14.730
I won't have to die?

00:17:14.730 --> 00:17:17.190
You will lose everything else, though.

00:17:18.560 --> 00:17:20.550
If you're prepared for that,

00:17:22.200 --> 00:17:24.300
then come with me.

00:17:30.880 --> 00:17:32.240
I don't want to die.

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:36.920
You've made the right choice.

00:17:43.640 --> 00:17:46.840
We are Polaris, the Administrators.

00:17:45.890 --> 00:17:49.540
Administrators  Polaris

00:17:47.260 --> 00:17:50.310
We serve Shasta, the ruler of this world.

00:17:55.290 --> 00:17:58.340
This medicine will stop the 
progression of your disease.

00:17:58.340 --> 00:17:59.930
Take it each time you have a seizure,

00:18:00.310 --> 00:18:02.380
and you will live a long life.

00:18:02.980 --> 00:18:05.400
Only we have the technology to create this.

00:18:11.220 --> 00:18:15.190
If you want it, ally yourself 
with the Blue World.

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:16.940
What's that?

00:18:16.940 --> 00:18:18.550
A Card Device.

00:18:18.550 --> 00:18:21.580
You will use it and become her partner.

00:18:24.230 --> 00:18:25.600
The girl from before...

00:18:25.600 --> 00:18:27.460
Sword Sniper Rigel.

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:32.210
You and she will execute 
the missions we give you.

00:18:33.350 --> 00:18:38.740
Understand that working with her 
is what will create your future.

00:18:43.990 --> 00:18:46.720
We are always watching you.

00:18:48.570 --> 00:18:51.510
We expect great things, human.

00:18:51.510 --> 00:18:52.730
And Rigel as well.

00:18:55.850 --> 00:19:00.560
Azumi, you and I are an inseparable team.

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:06.360
Target: lock on.

00:19:07.730 --> 00:19:08.620
Shoot!

00:19:10.180 --> 00:19:14.880
Without you, I will be cut off 
from my resources and die.

00:19:15.990 --> 00:19:20.460
And without me, you will 
die without your medicine.

00:19:23.490 --> 00:19:26.200
We need to understand 
each other so well

00:19:26.990 --> 00:19:29.970
that we can speak without words.

00:19:39.970 --> 00:19:41.500
Why are you smiling?

00:19:42.590 --> 00:19:44.650
Oh, no reason.

00:19:44.650 --> 00:19:45.680
Listen.

00:19:45.680 --> 00:19:49.550
If you experience any change that 
will interfere with our mission,

00:19:49.550 --> 00:19:52.040
I will eliminate its cause.

00:19:52.780 --> 00:19:54.170
I'm okay.

00:19:54.790 --> 00:19:56.360
I believe you.

00:19:56.360 --> 00:19:57.420
Here.

00:19:58.230 --> 00:19:59.610
This is for you.

00:20:00.770 --> 00:20:04.410
He said that if you eat it, 
your wish will come true.

00:20:04.410 --> 00:20:05.230
I don't need it.

00:20:05.230 --> 00:20:06.300
That's stupid.

00:20:25.180 --> 00:20:26.130
How is it?

00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:27.330
Is it good?

00:20:31.110 --> 00:20:33.160
What did you wish for?

00:20:33.160 --> 00:20:37.380
That you'll get better.

00:20:39.650 --> 00:20:40.520
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorms

00:20:40.520 --> 00:20:43.720
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorms
December 25th 23:01

00:20:40.680 --> 00:20:43.720
Why'd you leave before 
I got back, Fierte?

00:20:45.220 --> 00:20:46.220
Huh?

00:20:47.220 --> 00:20:48.250
She's gone.

00:20:50.310 --> 00:20:51.730
I knew it.

00:20:52.530 --> 00:20:55.480
Baths are the greatest.

00:20:58.210 --> 00:21:01.560
I'm glad. You seem to be feeling better.

00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:06.490
December 25th 23:45 Kobe - Kitano

00:21:06.800 --> 00:21:08.740
Merry Christmas!

